# src/apps/daemon/internal/integrations/provision

## Purpose
VPS/Cloudflare/Terraform provisioning implementation and billing schema.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `integrations` (rank 3; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

